      "itemDescription": "<span style=\"font-weight: 400\">With a 16% overall market share, State Farm is the nation\u2019s largest auto insurance provider, and it\u2019s the second-largest provider of life insurance. The company reported net losses on auto accident claims in 2021, but offset that financial hit with a record $116 billion in new policy volume across its business lines. State Farm celebrated its 100th anniversary in February 2022, and marked the occasion by awarding 100 grants of $25,000 each to nonprofit organizations to fund neighborhood improvement projects.</span>",
