        "alt": "G500-2020-114-State-Farm",
        "caption": "A customer wearing a protective mask waits to meet with State Farm representative in Cleveland, Mississippi, U.S., on Thursday, April 30, 2020. Some retail stores began reopening at half-capacity in Mississippi after the stay-at-home order expired on April 27. Photographer: Rory Doyle/Bloomberg via Getty Images",
